  m_Name: Chasenut
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CreatureData
  creatureName: 'Chasenut '
  description: "A strange critter similar to a peanut with legs and two brains, each
    with its own personality. The top half is very aggressive but the bottom half
    is shy, so if you are directly looking at it, it won\u2019t move. Either way,
    the most it can do is smash into your ankles and hit you with its small arms.\r\n"
  note: "One time I spent an entire expedition just running from one of these. It
    didn\u2019t scare me too much, but my ankles were sore from it hitting me non-stop.\r\n"
